          <td data-label="Our read">Strong</td>
          <td data-label="Why">It can be checked.</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td data-label="Type of graduate"><strong>Tailoring to each notice</strong></td>
          <td data-label="Our read">Strong</td>
          <td data-label="Why">It shows care.</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td data-label="Type of graduate"><strong>Short, three lines</strong></td>
          <td data-label="Our read">Good</td>
          <td data-label="Why">Recruiters skim.</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td data-label="Type of graduate"><strong>Generic adjectives</strong></td>
          <td data-label="Our read">Risky</td>
          <td data-label="Why">Easy to ignore.</td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <h2 id="evidence">What can be said with confidence, and what cannot</h2>

